#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""The Lujarch repository's command line.

  lujarch check                     check the repository against process/; exit 1 on any finding
  lujarch status [--list]           progress of the target, and code not yet meeting a convention
  lujarch pin                       write upstream.xml from the commits the tree has checked out
  lujarch sync                      sync the tree to upstream.xml, then apply the patches
  lujarch patch | unpatch           apply or revert the patches and vendor/extra in the tree
  lujarch save ENTRY [PROJECT...]   save the tree's changes into ENTRY's patches (features/x, device/y)
  lujarch build DEVICE [MODULE...]  build a device (fuxi, vm), or some of its modules
  lujarch stock DEVICE [--add GLOB] download and unpack a device's stock release; pin its files
  lujarch release                   tag, build, sign and verify a release of HEAD (fuxi)
  lujarch vm start|stop|status      the virtual device
  lujarch vm sync [MODULE...]       copy built modules, or what its images lack, into the running
                                    virtual device
  lujarch vm screenshot [PATH]      write what the virtual device's display shows
  lujarch test [SELECTOR...]        run the tests of the target's items on the virtual device
  lujarch test --script FILE [ARG...]
                                    run a Python file on the virtual device as a test runs
"""

